OL,3,GNEWSASurgeons warn of injury risk when
OL,4,Acarving pumpkins
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrauma specialists are warning people
OL,7,Fto be extra careful when carving
OL,8,Fpumpkins for Halloween after a rise in
OL,9,Fthe number of patients seeking help for
OL,10,Fserious hand injuries.
OL,12,FThe Plastic Hand Trauma Unit team at
OL,13,Fthe Royal Devon and Exeter Hospital
OL,14,Fsaid patients often arrived at the
OL,15,Femergency department with deep
OL,16,Flacerations, severed tendons and nerve
OL,17,Fdamage.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
