OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1792826772
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSASurgeons warn of injury risk when
OL,4,Acarving pumpkins
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbigail Owen, an advanced clinical
OL,7,Fpractitioner in plastics surgery, urged
OL,8,Fpeople not to use kitchen knifes to
OL,9,Fcarve and instead use a pumpkin carving
OL,10,Fkit which included a tool with a
OL,11,Fserrated edge.
OL,13,F"The problem with the kitchen knife is
OL,14,Fthey tend to slip and I think people
OL,15,Funderestimate how firm it is to cut
OL,16,Fthrough a pumpkin," she said.
